          "text": "🇵🇹 Today we join our comrades in @psocialista to commemorate the 100 year anniversary of the birth of Mário Soares.\n\n🌹 A historic figure, Soares fought tirelessly for democracy during the dictatorship period in Portugal, and as one of the founders of the PS, he played a pivotal role in steering the country towards EU membership (CEE) in 1986. After the fall of the dictatorship, he became the first constitutionally elected Prime Minister of Portugal and would later rise to become its first civilian President following the democratic transition.\n\n🇪🇺 His commitment to Europe and to the values of democracy and fairness continue to inspire many throughout the EU and the world."
